{"id": "09", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "You land in a small, warm room. Full of screens. Every screen... a different city. Every city... live."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And in the big chair... is a very old man. [pause] The old man from the garage sale."}, {"speaker": "OLDMAN", "text": "[tired, gentle] Ah. You found the server room. [pause] Sit down. Would you like some tea?"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[stunned] YOU'RE the Admin?! You SOLD me the laptop!"}, {"speaker": "OLDMAN", "text": "[chuckles] Every hundred years, I give the panel to one person. To see what they do with it."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[confused] Every hundred YEARS? How old ARE you?"}, {"speaker": "OLDMAN", "text": "[proud] I've been the admin since the very first player joined. [pause] A very confused dinosaur."}, {"speaker": "OLDMAN", "text": "[sighs] Most people want to fly. Be fast. Be big. Win."}, {"speaker": "OLDMAN", "text": "[chuckles] One fellow in nineteen sixty-four made himself nine feet tall. [pause] He couldn't fit through any doors. He was very sad."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[quiet] ...That's exactly what I did."}, {"speaker": "OLDMAN", "text": "[gentle] I know. I read the logs. [pause] Every single one."}, {"speaker": "OLDMAN", "text": "[kind] And you never once typed a command... to help somebody else."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[quiet] And he was right."}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "[calm] Battery... one percent."}, {"speaker": "OLDMAN", "text": "[gentle] Now I'll type \"undo all.\" Everything goes back. Including you."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[urgent] Wait! [pause] Let me fix it. Myself. One by one."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 9.48, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 102, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 9.48, "end_time_seconds": 16.240000000000002, "ch